eight=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Groovity</strong> offers a fresh and challenging experience, where by altering the environment you can do much more than just jump from platform to platform, gravity can be your greatest ally\u2026 and also your greatest challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587530/extras/32b1f0d697127306d936e6e686ab8411.poster.avif?t=1754404880\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587530/extras/32b1f0d697127306d936e6e686ab8411.webm?t=1754404880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587530/extras/32b1f0d697127306d936e6e686ab8411.mp4?t=1754404880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
